  colors: black(0) background, red(2) V arms, blue(1) lattice fill

generation_strategy:
  steps:
    1. pick odd N uniformly from {5, 7, 9, ..., 29}
    2. create input as 1 x N black row with red at col N//2
    3. output is deterministic from N via the solver formula
```
